{"title":"Pinarello Opens First U.S. Bottega in New York City","link":"https://bikerumor.com/pinarello-opens-bottega-soho/","date":1790352295000,"content":"<p><img src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Pinarello-Bottega-full-store--1536x1024.jpg\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" alt=\"Pinarello Bottega full store\" /></p>\n<p>Pinarello has opened its first Bottega outside Europe, planting a new flagship store at 114 Wooster Street in New York City’s SoHo neighborhood.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>The new space joins existing Pinarello Bottegas in London, Zurich, and Villorba, Italy, and gives the brand a USA showcase for its bikes, custom program, and a few pieces of racing history. Think of it as a Pinarello flagship store. </p>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Pinarello-Bottega-Myway-station-.jpg\"><img width=\"2500\" height=\"1667\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Pinarello-Bottega-Myway-station-.jpg\" alt=\"Pinarello Bottega Myway station\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Pinarello-Bottega-Myway-station-.jpg 2500w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Pinarello-Bottega-Myway-station--297x198.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Pinarello-Bottega-Myway-station--1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Pinarello-Bottega-Myway-station--120x80.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Pinarello-Bottega-Myway-station--768x512.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Pinarello-Bottega-Myway-station--2048x1366.jpg 2048w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Pinarello-Bottega-Myway-station--800x533.jpg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Pinarello-Bottega-Myway-station--720x480.jpg 720w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Pinarello-Bottega-Myway-station--1350x900.jpg 1350w\" /></a><figcaption><em>(All Photos/Pinarello)</em></figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<h2>Pinarello Lands in SoHo</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>The New York Bottega carries Pinarello’s full range, including the recently launched<a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/pinarello-all-new-dogma-x-preformance-road-endurance/\"> DOGMA X and X Series</a>, with dedicated space for bike fitting, service, and custom consultations.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>A major part of the store centers on Pinarello’s MyWay program, which lets customers customize both the paint and specifications of their frame. </p>\n\n\n\n<p>Pinarello is positioning its Bottega stores as the full brand experience rather than a traditional dealer floor packed wall-to-wall with inventory. Plus, the brand will do some activations out of the store (new products, etc.) and we’re guessing some rides with Pinarello athletes when available. </p>\n\n\n\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Pinarello-Bottega-Q36.5.jpg\"><img width=\"1536\" height=\"2304\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Pinarello-Bottega-Q36.5-1536x2304.jpg\" alt=\"Pinarello Bottega Q36.5\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Pinarello-Bottega-Q36.5-1536x2304.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Pinarello-Bottega-Q36.5-200x300.jpg 200w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Pinarello-Bottega-Q36.5-80x120.jpg 80w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Pinarello-Bottega-Q36.5-768x1152.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Pinarello-Bottega-Q36.5-1024x1536.jpg 1024w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Pinarello-Bottega-Q36.5-1366x2048.jpg 1366w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Pinarello-Bottega-Q36.5-600x900.jpg 600w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Pinarello-Bottega-Q36.5.jpg 1667w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Pinarello-Bottega-tall-.jpg\"><img width=\"1536\" height=\"2304\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Pinarello-Bottega-tall--1536x2304.jpg\" alt=\"Pinarello Bottega tall\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Pinarello-Bottega-tall--1536x2304.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Pinarello-Bottega-tall--200x300.jpg 200w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Pinarello-Bottega-tall--80x120.jpg 80w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Pinarello-Bottega-tall--768x1152.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Pinarello-Bottega-tall--1024x1536.jpg 1024w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Pinarello-Bottega-tall--1366x2048.jpg 1366w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Pinarello-Bottega-tall--600x900.jpg 600w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Pinarello-Bottega-tall-.jpg 1667w\" /></a></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p><em>“For us, a Bottega is more than just a store,”</em> said Pinarello president Fausto Pinarello. <em>“It is a space where cyclists can truly immerse themselves in our bikes, products and services, and experience the artistry that goes into every frame.”</em></p>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Pinarello-Pharrell-Williams-cyclocross.png\"><img width=\"704\" height=\"572\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Pinarello-Pharrell-Williams-cyclocross.png\" alt=\"Pinarello &amp; Pharrell Williams cyclocross\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Pinarello-Pharrell-Williams-cyclocross.png 704w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Pinarello-Pharrell-Williams-cyclocross-297x241.png 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Pinarello-Pharrell-Williams-cyclocross-120x98.png 120w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>That approach makes plenty of sense in SoHo, where bike shopping can sit pretty comfortably alongside high-end fashion and design. Just don’t expect to see this the creation above anytime soon. </p>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Pinarello-Bottega-ganna--scaled.jpg\"><img width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Pinarello-Bottega-ganna--scaled.jpg\" alt=\"Pinarello Bottega ganna\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Pinarello-Bottega-ganna--scaled.jpg 2560w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Pinarello-Bottega-ganna--297x198.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Pinarello-Bottega-ganna--1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Pinarello-Bottega-ganna--120x80.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Pinarello-Bottega-ganna--768x512.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Pinarello-Bottega-ganna--2048x1365.jpg 2048w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Pinarello-Bottega-ganna--800x533.jpg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Pinarello-Bottega-ganna--720x480.jpg 720w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Pinarello-Bottega-ganna--1350x900.jpg 1350w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3>More Than Just Pinarello Bikes</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>The new store also has dedicated areas for a handful of Pinarello-adjacent brands. Q36.5 cycling apparel and footwear gets its own space, along with Amacx sports nutrition and Partington carbon wheels.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><em>There’s some proper bike-nerd material in there too.</em></p>\n\n\n\n<p>One standout piece is Filippo Ganna’s Bolide F HR 3D, the bike used for his World Hour Record. If you’ve only ever seen photos of that thing, it’s probably worth stopping in for a closer look. That mix of current product and racing history gives the store a little more personality than a standard retail setup.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/new-Dogma-F-Post-21.6-2-Large.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"854\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/new-Dogma-F-Post-21.6-2-Large.jpeg\" alt=\"Pinarello Dogma F\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/new-Dogma-F-Post-21.6-2-Large.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/new-Dogma-F-Post-21.6-2-Large-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/new-Dogma-F-Post-21.6-2-Large-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/new-Dogma-F-Post-21.6-2-Large-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/new-Dogma-F-Post-21.6-2-Large-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/new-Dogma-F-Post-21.6-2-Large-720x480.jpeg 720w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3>Wanna Visit?</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>The new Bottega gives Pinarello four flagship locations worldwide and its first in the United States. The newest location is: </p>\n\n\n\n<p><em>Pinarello Bottega New York<br />114 Wooster Street<br />SoHo, New York City</em></p>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.q36-5.com/en-int/c/bottega-pinarello-new-york/?srsltid=AU7gw4V4PMz5biBw8kgRtwRBl7ZG8uX2M4LIxYofQ4tV0aTHNfVwv0Ou\"><em>For anyone who wants to see the latest DOGMA in person, spend some time with the MyWay configurator, or just stare at Ganna’s Hour Record bike for a while, the new SoHo store now gives Pinarello a proper home base in New York.</em></a></p>","author":"Jordan Villella","comments":"https://bikerumor.com/pinarello-opens-bottega-soho/#respond","siteTitle":"Bikerumor","siteHash":"49f427af0a926f4232eb837006841d7242e153e3afbb590f32e4b104ea3e2718","entryHash":"03d513c961148615cff65887b820c5ba04a3a6d63a3f445bb6f8fcbae84619b3","category":"Cycling"}